    "['mpls te bandwidth bc0 [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols mpls interface ge-1/0/0 bandwidth 4000', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the Juniper equivalent of the HUAWEI command `mpls te bandwidth bc0 4000`:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols mpls interface ge-1/0/0 bandwidth 4000\\n##\\n\\nThis Juniper command:\\n1. Sets the MPLS bandwidth for interface ge-1/0/0 (equivalent to GigabitEthernet1/0/0)\\n2. Configures 4000 as the bandwidth value (in Mbps)\\n3. In Juniper, this would be configured under the interface hierarchy rather than as a separate MPLS TE bandwidth class (bc0) as in HUAWEI\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols mpls interface ge-1/0/0 bandwidth 4000'}]]": 1,
